ent settings > your subscription\\n3. Open Defender plans\\n4. Set \\"Defender for Azure Resource Manager\\" to On/Standard\\n5. Click Save", "nativeiac": "```bicep\\n// Enable Microsoft Defender for Azure Resource Manager at Standard tier\\nresource example_pricing 'Microsoft.Security/pricings@2023-01-01' = {\\n  name: 'Arm'\\n  properties: {\\n    pricingTier: 'Standard' // Critical: sets Defender for ARM plan to Standard (ON)\\n  }\\n}\\n```", "terraform": "```hcl\\n# Enable Microsoft Defender for Azure Resource Manager at Standard tier\\nresource \\"azurerm_security_center_subscription_pricing\\" \\"<example_resource_name>\\" {\\n  tier          = \\"Standard\\"   # Critical: enables Standard pricing (ON)\\n  resource_type = \\"Arm\\"        # Critical: targets Defender for Azure Resource Manager\\n}\\n```"}, "recommendation": {"url": "https://hub.prowler.com/check/defender_ensure_defender_for_arm_is_on", "text": "Enable Microsoft Defender for **Azure Resource Manager** at the `Standard` tier across all subscriptions. Apply least privilege to deployment principals, enforce the plan via policy for new subscriptions, and route alerts to centralized monitoring to support defense-in-depth and rapid response."}}, "servicename": "defender", "checkaliases": [], "resourcetype": "microsoft.security/pricings", "resourcegroup": "security", "additionalurls": ["https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/blog/coreinfrastructureandsecurityblog/switch-to-the-new-defender-for-resource-manager-pricing-plan/4001636", "https://www.trendmicro.com/cloudoneconformity/knowledge-base/azure/SecurityCenter/pricing-tier.html"], "subservicename": "", "resourceidtemplate": ""}	{}	01a00eb6-f60f-7f84-8f37-b0e40a3c7793	3e59acc5-3bdd-499e-8fd1-3e53b0a6ca47	2026-08-17 13:24:57.183275+05:30	f	{"NIS2": ["3.6.2", "6.9.2"], "SOC2": ["cc_3_1", "cc_3_2", "cc_4_2", "cc_6_8", "cc_7_1"], "HIPAA": ["164_308_a_1_ii_a"], "C5-2025": ["OPS-04.01B"], "CIS-2.0": ["2.1.12"], "CIS-2.1": ["2.1.11"], "CIS-3.0": ["3.1.9.1"]