er for Cloud\\n2. Select Environment settings > choose <subscription>\\n3. Open Pricing & settings\\n4. Find the Containers plan and set it to On (Standard)\\n5. Click Save", "nativeiac": "```bicep\\n// Subscription-level deployment to enable Defender for Containers\\ntargetScope = 'subscription'\\n\\nresource <example_resource_name> 'Microsoft.Security/pricings@2023-01-01' = {\\n  name: 'Containers'\\n  properties: {\\n    pricingTier: 'Standard' // Critical: sets Defender for Containers plan to ON (Standard)\\n  }\\n}\\n```", "terraform": "```hcl\\nresource \\"azurerm_security_center_subscription_pricing\\" \\"<example_resource_name>\\" {\\n  resource_type = \\"Containers\\"   # Critical: targets Defender for Containers plan\\n  tier          = \\"Standard\\"     # Critical: enables Standard (ON)\\n}\\n```"}, "recommendation": {"url": "https://hub.prowler.com/check/defender_ensure_defender_for_containers_is_on", "text": "Enable the **Defender for Containers** plan at `Standard` for all relevant subscriptions. Apply **least privilege**, integrate alerts with response workflows, and use **defense in depth**: signed images, private registries, RBAC, network policies, and periodic reviews to maintain consistent coverage."}}, "servicename": "defender", "checkaliases": [], "resourcetype": "microsoft.security/pricings", "resourcegroup": "security", "additionalurls": ["https://www.trendmicro.com/cloudoneconformity/knowledge-base/azure/SecurityCenter/defender-container.html", "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/defender-for-containers-introduction"], "subservicename": "", "resourceidtemplate": ""}	{}	01a00eb6-f60f-7f84-8f37-b0e40a3c7793	3e59acc5-3bdd-499e-8fd1-3e53b0a6ca47	2026-08-17 13:24:57.259396+05:30	f	{"NIS2": ["3.6.2", "6.9.2"], "SOC2": ["cc_3_1", "cc_3_2", "cc_4_2", "cc_6_8", "cc_7_1"], "HIPAA": ["164_308_a_1_ii_a"], "C5-2025": ["OPS-04.01B", "OPS-32.01B"], "CIS-2.0": ["2.1.8"], "CIS-2.1": ["2.1.8"], "CIS-3.0": ["3.1.4.1"], "CIS-4.0": ["9.1.