Open Defender plans\\n4. Find DNS and set the plan to Standard (On)\\n5. Click Save", "nativeiac": "```bicep\\n// Enable Microsoft Defender for DNS at subscription scope\\ntargetScope = 'subscription'\\n\\nresource example_resource_name 'Microsoft.Security/pricings@2023-01-01' = {\\n  name: 'Dns'\\n  properties: {\\n    pricingTier: 'Standard' // Critical: sets Defender for DNS to ON (Standard tier)\\n  }\\n}\\n```", "terraform": "```hcl\\nresource \\"azurerm_security_center_subscription_pricing\\" \\"example_resource_name\\" {\\n  resource_type = \\"Dns\\"\\n  tier          = \\"Standard\\" # Critical: enables Defender for DNS\\n}\\n```"}, "recommendation": {"url": "https://hub.prowler.com/check/defender_ensure_defender_for_dns_is_on", "text": "Enable **Defender for DNS** at the `Standard` tier across applicable subscriptions. Apply **defense in depth**: restrict outbound DNS, use private DNS where feasible, and log/monitor query activity. Route alerts to centralized monitoring. Enforce **least privilege** on security settings and review exclusions regularly."}}, "servicename": "defender", "checkaliases": [], "resourcetype": "microsoft.security/pricings", "resourcegroup": "security", "additionalurls": ["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/defender-for-dns-introduction", "https://support.icompaas.com/support/solutions/articles/62000234089-ensure-that-microsoft-defender-for-dns-is-set-to-on-automated-"], "subservicename": "", "resourceidtemplate": ""}	{}	01a00ebe-f142-79dc-93c6-b0d816338b10	3e59acc5-3bdd-499e-8fd1-3e53b0a6ca47	2026-08-17 13:24:57.37588+05:30	f	{"NIS2": ["3.6.2", "6.7.2.i", "6.7.2.l", "6.9.2"], "SOC2": ["cc_3_1", "cc_3_2", "cc_4_2", "cc_6_8", "cc_7_1"], "HIPAA": ["164_308_a_1_ii_a"], "C5-2025": ["OPS-04.01B"], "CIS-2.0": ["2.1.11"], "CIS-2.1": ["2.1.10"], "CIS-3.0": ["3.1.16"], "CIS-4.0": ["9.1.17"], "ENS-RD2022": ["mp.s.4.r1.az.nt.3"], "MITRE-ATTACK": ["T1190", "T1486", "T1499"], "ISO27001-2022": ["A.5.16", "A.5.19", "A.5.21", 